*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0012
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-06-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 120
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0012.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY INT0012C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 INTEREST-RATE      PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 3000-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "INTEREST-RATE=" INTEREST-RATE
    STOP RUN.
3000-TERM-RATE.
    *> SHORT TERM DEPOSIT RATE
    IF DEPOSIT-TERM >= 1 AND <= 3
        MOVE 0.0275 TO INTEREST-RATE
    ELSE
        *> MEDIUM TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        IF DEPOSIT-TERM >= 4 AND <= 18
            MOVE 0.0350 TO INTEREST-RATE
        ELSE
            *> LONG TERM DEPOSIT RATE
            IF DEPOSIT-TERM >= 19 AND <= 36
                MOVE 0.0425 TO INTEREST-RATE
            ELSE
                MOVE 0.0200 TO INTEREST-RATE
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
